    "text": "## Refactoring Complete \u2713\n\nI've successfully refactored the Ada's Coffee Shop Rewards system to address all three requirements:\n\n### 1. **Removed duplicated code in tests 2 & 3**\n   - Created helper method `verifySalesTo:ofProduct:count:` to extract common test pattern\n   - Both tests now use the same verification logic\n\n### 2. **Removed duplicated code in tests 9-14**\n   - Created `verifyCombo2RewardFor:quantity:price:` for tests 9-11 (Combo2 rewards)\n   - Created `verifyRewardFor:withCombo1:quantity:price:` for tests 12-14 (Combo1 rewards)\n   - Tests now focus on the specific test data rather than repetitive setup/assertion logic\n\n### 3. **Replaced if statements with polymorphism**\n   - Created `CustomerType` hierarchy: `GoldCustomerType`, `SilverCustomerType`, `NormalCustomerType`\n   - Created `Product` hierarchy: `Combo1Product`, `Combo2Product`\n   - Eliminated if-checks for customer types in reward rules by delegating to `rewardPriceFor:` and `fixedRewardPrice:` methods\n   - Eliminated if-checks for product types by delegating to Product objects for volume/price queries\n   - Updated `CoffeeShopCustomer` to work with CustomerType instances instead of symbols\n\n**All 14 tests pass.** The image has been saved and packages are ready to file out when you request it."
